*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s (200%) spawn, delay 0.07~0.2 seconds<sup>2f~6f</sup>.
**5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.2 seconds<sup>2f~6f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 97% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
**5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.2 seconds<sup>2f~6f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 95% HP:
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s (200%) spawn, delay 0.07~0.2 seconds<sup>2f~6f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 92% HP:
**1 [[Master A.]] spawns.
